  "chapter": {
    "bookTitle": "Psalms",
    "delineation": "Psalm",
    "number": 47,
    "summary": "The Lord is King over all the earth—Sing praises to His name, for He reigns over all.",
    "chapterAugmentations": [],
    "verses": [
      {
        "text": "O clap your hands, all ye people; shout unto God with the voice of triumph.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "For the Lord most high is terrible; he is a great King over all the earth.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 26,
            "end": 34,
            "text": "Deut. 7:21; D&C 1:9 (9–10)."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 23,
            "end": 25
          },
          {
            "start": 36,
            "end": 41
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "He shall subdue the people under us, and the nations under our feet.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 9,
            "end": 15,
            "text": "Ps. 18:47."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "He shall choose our inheritance for us, the excellency of Jacob whom he loved. Selah.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "God is gone up with a shout, the Lord with the sound of a trumpet.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "Sing praises to God, sing praises: sing praises unto our King, sing praises.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "For God is the King of all the earth: sing ye praises with understanding.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 15,
            "end": 19,
            "text": "Zech. 14:9."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 8,
            "end": 10
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "God reigneth over the heathen: God sitteth upon the throne of his holiness.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 22,
            "end": 29,
            "text": "HEB nations, Gentiles."
          },
          {
            "start": 35,
            "end": 42,
            "text": "Rev. 7:15; D&C 88:13."
          },
          {
            "start": 52,
            "end": 58,
            "text": "TG Kingdom of God, in Heaven."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "The princes of the people are gathered together, even the people of the God of Abraham: for the shields of the earth belong unto God: he is greatly exalted.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 96,
            "end": 103,
            "text": "Ps. 89:18."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 49,
            "end": 53
          },
          {
            "start": 117,
            "end": 123
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": []
      }
    ]
  },
